## Phase 2 Accomplishments: UI & Navigation Integration

1. **Store & Warehouse Master UI**:
   - [`src/routes/_authenticated/inventory/stores.tsx`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/routes/_authenticated/inventory/stores.tsx)
   - Store directory listing with code, type badges, default store indicator, and location.
   - Interactive dialog modal to create and edit stores (Central Warehouse, Retail Pharmacy, Ward Sub-store, College Dispensary, Laboratory Store).

2. **Live Stock Inquiry Page**:
   - [`src/routes/_authenticated/inventory/stock.tsx`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/routes/_authenticated/inventory/stock.tsx)
   - Live batch-level balance grid showing store location, item name, batch number, MRP, cost rate, on hand qty, and available qty.
   - **Expiry Color-Coding**:
     - Red badge: Expired or expiring within 30 days.
     - Amber badge: Expiring within 30–90 days.
     - Green badge: Healthy expiry date (>90 days).
   - Multi-field search and store filter dropdown.

3. **Immutable Stock Ledger Viewer**:
   - [`src/routes/_authenticated/inventory/ledger.tsx`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/routes/_authenticated/inventory/ledger.tsx)
   - Complete audit trail viewer displaying timestamp, store, item, batch number, movement type badge (GRN Inward, POS Sale, Transfer In/Out, Adjustments), reference ID, quantity change (+ / -), balance after, and recording user.

4. **Sidebar Navigation & Authorization**:
   - [`src/components/Shell.tsx`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/components/Shell.tsx)
   - Added "Inventory & Store" collapsible navigation section with links to Stores Master, Live Stock Inquiry, and Stock Ledger.
   - Extended permissions in [`src/lib/permissions.ts`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/lib/permissions.ts) (`canViewInventory`, `canManageStores`) and backend guards in [`server/routes/shared.ts`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/routes/shared.ts).

5. **GRN Store Selection Integration**:
   - Updated [`$id_.grn.new.tsx`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/routes/_authenticated/purchases/purchase-orders/$id_.grn.new.tsx) and [`$grnId_.edit.tsx`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/routes/_authenticated/purchases/grns/$grnId_.edit.tsx) with a required "Receiving Store" selector populated dynamically from active stores.

